SUMMARY:The Vinyl Tones and Fry Boys
DESCRIPTION:Live Music & Food Truck Friday in Davis  Friday\, September 18 | 5–8:30pm\nKick off your weekend the right way—with live music\, delicious burgers\, loaded fries\, and a glass of wine at the vineyard! \nJoin us for an easygoing Friday evening featuring The Vinyl Tones and The Fry Boys. Grab your friends\, find a spot on the lawn\, sip your favorite wine\, and settle in for a night of good food and great tunes. \n Live Music by The Vinyl Tones | 6–7:30pmGet ready to groove! This Sacramento-based 3-piece rock band brings the best hits from the ’60s and ’70s\, creating the perfect soundtrack for a night of wine\, dancing\, and vineyard vibes. \n Food by The Fry Boys | 5–8:30pmWe’re excited to welcome The Fry Boys back to Great Bear! Dig into fresh\, gourmet burgers made with juicy\, hand-pressed patties\, plus their crave-worthy loaded fries. \n Your Ticket Includes: A glass of wine Live music A relaxing evening at the vineyard\nBring your friends\, bring your appetite\, and leave the workweek behind! Good food + great music + wine = the perfect Friday night. \nPlease note: Food is available for purchase from The Fry Boys. To support our local food truck partner\, please do not bring outside food.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/the-vinyl-tones-and-fry-boys/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://visityolo.com/wp-content/uploads/Highway128PressTrip_GreatBearVineyards_2024_MaxWhittaker_12-Copy-scaled.jpg
ORGANIZER;CN="Great Bear Vineyards":MAILTO:greatbearvineyards@gmail.com
END:VEVENT
