SUMMARY:Paired to Perfection: A Five Course Wine and Culinary Experience
DESCRIPTION:Paired to Perfection: A Five-Course Wine & Culinary Experience in Davis   Saturday\, September 19 | 6:00 PM\nTicket Includes: A Five-Course Chef-Crafted Menu with Curated Wine or Mocktail Pairings\nJoin us for an evening of exceptional food\, award-winning wine\, and connection. Paired to Perfection is an elevated dining experience celebrating the very best of Great Bear Vineyards. Over the course of five thoughtfully crafted dishes\, you’ll discover how carefully selected seasonal ingredients and estate-grown wines can transform a meal into something truly memorable.\nEach course has been expertly designed to complement the next\, creating a seamless journey through flavor\, texture\, and aroma. Whether you’re a devoted foodie\, passionate wine lover\, or simply looking for a special evening out\, this is an experience to be savored.\nTicket Options\n Dinner Only – $78\n Dinner + Mocktail Pairings – $108\n Dinner + Curated Wine Pairings – $120All prices include gratuity.\nMenu 1 — Full MenuA five-course menu featuring seafood\, seasonal produce\, American Wagyu and a sweet corn dessert.\nMenu 2 — VegetarianA five-course vegetarian menu showcasing fresh produce\, burrata\, braised leeks\, grilled oyster mushrooms and sweet corn cake.\nPlease email greatbearvineyards@gmail.com your menu preference.\nGather your favorite people and join us for an unforgettable evening where every sip and every bite tells a story. Saturday\, September 19 | 6pm Great Bear Vineyards\, Davis\nReservations required — email greatbearvineyards@gmail.com to select your preferred menu.
URL:https://visityolo.com/event/paired-to-perfection-a-five-course-wine-and-culinary-experience/
LOCATION:Great Bear Vineyards\, Great Bear Vineyards  24800 Co Rd 101A\, Davis\, CA 95616
